<h2>Your <%= app_name %> account</h2>

<p>Someone (hopefully you) asked for a link to manage your <strong><%= app_name %></strong> licences and purchases for <%= customer_email or "your account" %>.</p>

<p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0;">
  <a href="<%= link %>" class="btn">Open my account</a>
</p>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #9ca3af;">
  The link works once and expires in <strong><%= expires_minutes or 15 %> minutes</strong>.
  If you didn't ask for it, you can ignore this email.
</p>
